# Omarchy package names -> FreeBSD ports origins.
#
# Omarchy's commands name Arch packages. omarchy-pkg-add, -present, -missing
# and -drop translate each name through this table:
#
#   <origin>   a FreeBSD port, installed and queried with pkg(8) by origin
#   @base      provided by the FreeBSD base system; always present
#   -          no FreeBSD equivalent (Linux kernel, firmware, bootloader or
#              Arch tooling specific, or a proprietary Linux-only binary)
